ben: SGTM. Please add a short rollback doc (how to pin `on_demand_percentage_above_base_capacity = 100` and drain spot nodes). :thumbsup:

ashwin: Will add rollback steps to the PR description and open a small runbook under /runbooks/preemptible-rollback.md. Planning to apply the canary tomorrow morning at 08:00 PT.

